==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[needle-in-a-haystack]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[needle]] [[in]] [[a]] [[haystack]]|-}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} Something that is [[difficult]] or [[impossible]] to locate; something impossibly [[complex]] or [[intractable]].
#: ''You'll never find the paper you need on her desk.  You're looking for a '''needle in a haystack'''.''

====Synonyms====
* [[needle in a straw poll]]

